Perfect! I found the answer in both files.

Looking at the proto file at proto/api/v1/memo_service.proto:21-27, the CreateMemo RPC is defined with:
```proto
rpc CreateMemo(CreateMemoRequest) returns (Memo) {
  option (google.api.http) = {
    post: "/api/v1/memos"
    body: "memo"
  };
}
```

This is confirmed in the generated gateway code at proto/gen/api/v1/memo_service.pb.gw.go:962 where it registers the handler with `http.MethodPost` and `pattern_MemoService_CreateMemo_0`, with the HTTP path pattern `/api/v1/memos` (line 968).

